forms have been found for this gene. [provided by RefSeq, Oct 2011].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q9BW91","text":"Hydrolyzes ADP-ribose (ADPR) to AMP and ribose 5'-phosphate (PubMed:11385575, PubMed:37343711). Has also a weak phosphohydrolase activity against NADH and FAD (in vitro) (PubMed:37343711)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}